> IDE:
> PC164 reputedly can boot from IDE disks [anybody to confirm this?] assuming
> your SRM is new enough.
> 
> Samsung PC164UX:
> Whether FreeBSD/alpha runs on this board is unknown. Please let me know if
> it does.
